{"title": "Elaborate Slate", "pageid": 6478, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elaborate_Slate", "categories": ["Slates", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Inscribed_Githyanki_Slate_(map)\" title=\"Inscribed Githyanki Slate (map)\">Inscribed Githyanki Slate (map)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png/300px-Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d1/Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elaborate Slate image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png/300px-Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Elaborate_Slate_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Elaborate Slate</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story Item</a> related to the <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Githyanki_Cr%C3%A8che\" title=\"Find the Githyanki Crèche\">Find the Githyanki Crèche</a> quest.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Circular script embellishes the slate's smooth edges.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slates\" title=\"Slates\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slates\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slates\" title=\"Slates\">Slates</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> can use this item to locate a <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Githyanki crèche</a>. Once used, the slate is renamed to <b>Githyanki Map</b>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <a href=\"/wiki/Sarth_Baretha\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sarth Baretha\">Sarth Baretha</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Mountain_Pass\" title=\"Mountain Pass\">Mountain Pass</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 303.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 301.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept Art\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png/452px-Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png/678px-Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png/904px-Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept Art\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png/452px-Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"302\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Githyanki_Map_Concept_Art.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept Art</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 535.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 533.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept Art\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp/800px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp/1200px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp/1600px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept Art\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp/800px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-mics-2.webp